      <h1 class="legal__title">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="legal__updated">Last updated: 9 October 2026</p>

      <p>Welcome to Nookaa. These Terms &amp; Conditions (&ldquo;Terms&rdquo;) apply when you use the Nookaa app, website or outlets (the &ldquo;Platform&rdquo;). They are an electronic record under the Information Technology Act, 2000. By creating an account, ordering, buying a Membership Pack, using a coupon, or earning or redeeming Nooks, you agree to these Terms and to our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

      <nav class="legal__toc" aria-label="On this page">
        <h2 class="legal__toc-title">On this page</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="#about">About Nookaa</a></li>
          <li><a href="#account">Your account</a></li>
          <li><a href="#drinks">Our drinks</a></li>
          <li><a href="#ordering">Ordering at our outlets</a></li>
          <li><a href="#payment">Prices and payment</a></li>
          <li><a href="#refunds">Refund policy</a></li>
          <li><a href="#membership">Membership Pack</a></li>
          <li><a href="#nooks">Nooks</a></li>
          <li><a href="#coupons">Coupons and offers</a></li>
          <li><a href="#money">Cashback and Nookaa Money</a></li>
          <li><a href="#referrals">Referrals</a></li>
          <li><a href="#outlets">At our outlets</a></li>
          <li><a href="#reviews">Reviews and feedback</a></li>
          <li><a href="#platform">Using the Platform</a></li>
          <li><a href="#ip">Intellectual property</a></li>
          <li><a href="#liability">Limitation of liability</a></li>
          <li><a href="#indemnity">Indemnity</a></li>
          <li><a href="#closing">Closing your account</a></li>
          <li><a href="#changes">Changes to these Terms</a></li>
          <li><a href="#law">Governing law and disputes</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact">Contact and grievances</a></li>
          <li><a href="#general">General</a></li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <section id="about">
        <h2>1. About Nookaa</h2>
        <p>Nookaa is a beverage brand that crafts and serves its own non-alcoholic drinks at Nookaa outlets in Mumbai. Nookaa operates as a grab-and-go brand serving beverages only. Orders are collected at the outlet counter for takeaway; we do not offer delivery. Any seating is limited and temporary, for a brief stop. Nookaa prepares every drink on its menu and is responsible for its quality and food safety under the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="account">
        <h2>2. Your account</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>You must be 18 or older to create an account.</li>
          <li>You sign in with your mobile number and an OTP. Adding an email address is optional.</li>
          <li>You are responsible for all activity on your account. Never share your OTP.</li>
          <li>One account per person. Fake, duplicate or misused accounts may be suspended.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="drinks">
        <h2>3. Our drinks</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Made fresh:</strong> every drink is prepared to order and is best enjoyed straight away. Please consume it at the outlet soon after it is served.</li>
          <li><strong>Customisation:</strong> you can choose options such as size, milk, sweetness and ice where offered. Taste, colour and appearance may vary slightly between servings because drinks are handmade.</li>
          <li><strong>Ingredients and allergens:</strong> ingredient and allergen information is shown on the menu where available. Our drinks may contain or come into contact with milk, nuts, soy, gluten or other allergens. If you have an allergy, please speak to our staff before ordering.</li>
          <li><strong>Caffeine:</strong> some drinks contain caffeine. They may not be suitable for pregnant or breastfeeding women, people sensitive to caffeine, or children.</li>
          <li><strong>Hot drinks:</strong> hot beverages are served very hot. Please handle them with care.</li>
          <li><strong>Menu changes:</strong> drinks, ingredients, seasonal specials and prices may change, and items may sometimes be unavailable.</li>
          <li><strong>Images:</strong> menu photos are for illustration and may differ from the drink served.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="ordering">
        <h2>4. Ordering at our outlets</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Select your outlet in the app, choose your drinks and pay.</li>
          <li>Your order is accepted when the app shows &ldquo;Order accepted&rdquo;. From that point we start preparing it.</li>
          <li>If we cannot fulfil your order, we will cancel it and refund you in full.</li>
          <li>Collect your drinks at the outlet counter. We do not offer table service or table reservations.</li>
          <li>Outside food and beverages are not allowed at our outlets.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section id="payment">
        <h2>5. Prices and payment</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>All prices are in Indian Rupees and include applicable GST. You will see the full amount before you pay.</li>
          <li>Nookaa does not charge any platform fee, convenience fee or service charge. Tips are optional.</li>
          <li>Payments are processed by licensed payment partners. Nookaa does not store your card, UPI or bank details.</li>
          <li>If a price is shown incorrectly because of an obvious error, we may cancel the order and refund you in full.</li>
          <li>You will receive a digital receipt for every order.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="refunds">
        <h2>6. Refund policy</h2>
        <div class="legal__table-wrap">
          <table class="legal__table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th scope="col">Situation</th>
                <th scope="col">Refund</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>You cancel before the order is accepted</td>
                <td>Full refund</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>You cancel after the order is accepted</td>
                <td>No refund, as your drink is already being prepared</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>We cancel your order or an item is unavailable</td>
                <td>Full refund for those items</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Wrong drink, missing item, spilled or spoiled drink</td>
                <td>Tell our staff or report it in the app before you leave the outlet. We will remake the drink or refund it.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Order paid for but not served</td>
                <td>Full refund</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Payment deducted but order not placed</td>
                <td>Automatic refund</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>A change of mind about taste or customisation after a drink has been correctly prepared is not eligible for a refund.</li>
          <li>Refunds go to your original payment method, usually within 5&ndash;7 working days, or instantly to your Nookaa Money if you choose.</li>
          <li>If an order paid partly with a coupon, Nooks or Nookaa Money is refunded, the amount you paid is refunded to its source. Nooks used are returned to your account. A coupon is restored only if it is still valid.</li>
          <li>Cashback earned on a refunded order will be reversed.</li>
          <li>This policy does not affect your rights under the Consumer Protection Act, 2019.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="membership">
        <h2>7. Membership Pack</h2>
        <p>The Nookaa Membership Pack gives you drink benefits for a fixed period, as described in the app.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Benefits:</strong> the price, benefits, validity, eligible drinks, eligible outlets and daily usage limits are shown in the app before you buy.</li>
          <li><strong>Activation:</strong> your Membership Pack starts as soon as your payment is successful.</li>
          <li><strong>Personal use:</strong> a Membership Pack is linked to one account and is for your use only. It cannot be shared, transferred, resold or used to order for others unless the pack says otherwise.</li>
          <li><strong>Usage:</strong> benefits must be used at the outlet in person. Unused daily or monthly benefits do not carry forward and cannot be exchanged for cash.</li>
          <li><strong>Auto-renewal:</strong> if you choose auto-renewal, your pack renews automatically at the end of each period. You will be notified before each renewal charge.</li>
          <li><strong>Cancelling:</strong> you can turn off auto-renewal at any time in the app, in just a few taps. Your benefits continue until the end of the period you have already paid for.</li>
          <li><strong>Refunds:</strong> Membership Pack fees are not refundable once the pack period has started, except where required by law, if we cannot provide the benefits, or as stated in the app at the time of purchase.</li>
          <li><strong>Changes:</strong> if we change the price or benefits of a pack, we will tell you before your next renewal so that you can choose whether to continue. Changes never apply to a period you have already paid for.</li>
          <li><strong>Misuse:</strong> we may suspend or cancel a Membership Pack without refund if it is shared, resold or misused.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="nooks">
        <h2>8. Nooks</h2>
        <p>Nooks are Nookaa&rsquo;s reward points.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Earning:</strong> you earn Nooks on eligible paid orders and activities, at the rates shown in the app. Nooks are credited once your order has been served.</li>
          <li><strong>Redeeming:</strong> Nooks can be redeemed for drinks, discounts or other rewards shown in the app.</li>
          <li><strong>No cash value:</strong> Nooks have no cash value. They cannot be sold, transferred to another account or exchanged for money.</li>
          <li><strong>Expiry:</strong> Nooks may expire after the period shown in the app. We will remind you before they expire where possible.</li>
          <li><strong>Refunded orders:</strong> if an order is refunded or cancelled, any Nooks earned on it will be removed. Nooks you used on that order will be returned.</li>
          <li><strong>Account closure:</strong> unused Nooks lapse when your account is deleted.</li>
          <li><strong>Misuse:</strong> Nooks earned through fraud, fake orders, multiple accounts or abuse of the programme will be cancelled.</li>
          <li><strong>Changes:</strong> we may change earning rates, rewards or the Nooks programme with prior notice in the app. Nooks you have already earned remain usable until their stated expiry.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="coupons">
        <h2>9. Coupons and offers</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>One per order:</strong> only one coupon can be applied per order unless the offer says otherwise.</li>
          <li><strong>Conditions:</strong> each coupon has its own conditions, such as minimum order value, eligible drinks, outlets, days, times and a maximum discount. These are shown with the coupon.</li>
          <li><strong>Validity:</strong> coupons are valid only during the stated period and cannot be extended.</li>
          <li><strong>Personal and non-transferable:</strong> coupons sent to you are for your account only, unless marked as shareable. They cannot be sold or exchanged for cash.</li>
          <li><strong>Combining offers:</strong> unless stated otherwise, coupons cannot be combined with other coupons, offers, or Membership Pack benefits.</li>
          <li><strong>Membership Pack purchases:</strong> coupons cannot be used on Membership Pack purchases unless the coupon says so.</li>
          <li><strong>Refunded orders:</strong> if an order is refunded, the coupon is restored only if it is still valid. Its value is never paid out as cash.</li>
          <li><strong>Misuse:</strong> we may cancel coupons and related orders, and suspend accounts, if coupons are misused, for example through multiple accounts, automated tools or sharing personal codes publicly.</li>
          <li><strong>Changes:</strong> we may modify or withdraw any offer at any time, but this will not affect orders already placed.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="money">
        <h2>10. Cashback and Nookaa Money</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Cashback is credited to your Nookaa Money after a qualifying order is served. It is reversed if the order is refunded.</li>
          <li>Your Nookaa Money balance can only be used for Nookaa orders and Membership Packs. It cannot be withdrawn as cash or transferred to another person.</li>
          <li>Money you add to Nookaa Money is refunded to your original payment method if you delete your account.</li>
          <li>Cashback and promotional credit have no cash value, are non-refundable and may expire as shown in the app.</li>
          <li>We may temporarily freeze your Nookaa Money if we suspect fraud or misuse.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="referrals">
        <h2>11. Referrals</h2>
        <p>You may earn rewards for inviting friends to Nookaa, as described in the app. Rewards are given only for genuine new users. Self-referrals, fake accounts and spam will lead to rewards being cancelled.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="outlets">
        <h2>12. At our outlets</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Please treat our team and other guests with respect. We may refuse service to anyone who is abusive, unsafe or disruptive. Any accepted order will then be refunded.</li>
          <li>Any seating is small and temporary and intended for a brief stop. Our outlets are not designed for extended stays, work or study sessions.</li>
          <li>Please keep our outlets clean and do not damage furniture or equipment.</li>
          <li>Smoking, vaping and alcohol are not allowed inside our outlets.</li>
          <li>Nookaa is not responsible for personal belongings left unattended.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="reviews">
        <h2>13. Reviews and feedback</h2>
        <p>Reviews must be honest and based on your own experience. We do not publish fake or paid reviews. By posting a review, you allow Nookaa to display it on the Platform. Ideas or feedback you share may be used to improve our drinks and services, without any obligation to you.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="platform">
        <h2>14. Using the Platform</h2>
        <p>You must not break the law, place fake orders, post offensive or unlawful content, impersonate others, or attempt to hack, copy or disrupt the app or website. We may suspend or close accounts that do so.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="ip">
        <h2>15. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>The Nookaa name, logo, the name Nooks, drink names, recipes, menu designs, photos, app and website belong to Nookaa. You may not copy or use them without our written permission.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="liability">
        <h2>16. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>The Platform is provided on an &ldquo;as is&rdquo; and &ldquo;as available&rdquo; basis. To the extent the law allows, Nookaa is not liable for indirect or consequential losses, and our total liability for any order is limited to the amount paid for that order. Nothing in these Terms limits liability that cannot be excluded by law.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="indemnity">
        <h2>17. Indemnity</h2>
        <p>You agree to compensate Nookaa for any loss caused by your breach of these Terms, your violation of law or your infringement of another person&rsquo;s rights.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="closing">
        <h2>18. Closing your account</h2>
        <p>You can delete your account at any time from the app&rsquo;s settings. When you do, Membership Pack auto-renewal is cancelled, money you added to Nookaa Money is refunded, and unused Nooks, cashback, coupons and promotional credit lapse. We may suspend or close accounts that violate these Terms. For the steps, see <a href="https://nookaa.in/delete-account">how to delete your account</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="changes">
        <h2>19. Changes to these Terms</h2>
        <p>We may update these Terms from time to time and will notify you of significant changes in the app. If you continue to use the Platform after an update, you accept the revised Terms.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="law">
        <h2>20. Governing law and disputes</h2>
        <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of India. Please contact us first so we can try to resolve any concern. You may also contact the National Consumer Helpline (1915) or file a complaint with the appropriate Consumer Commission. Subject to your rights as a consumer, the courts in Mumbai, Maharashtra have exclusive jurisdiction.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="contact">
        <h2>21. Contact and grievances</h2>
        <p>For help or complaints, contact us through Help &amp; Support in the Nookaa app. The name and contact details of our Grievance Officer are displayed in the app and on our website. We will acknowledge your complaint within 48 hours and aim to resolve it within one month.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="general">
        <h2>22. General</h2>
        <p>If any part of these Terms is found unenforceable, the rest remains in effect. Our failure to enforce a right is not a waiver of it. These Terms, together with our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>, are the entire agreement between you and Nookaa.</p>
      </section>
